  m_text: "I remember now\u2014 \n\n\nI recorded a photo of a car accident. \n\n\nIt
    seemed connected to people from my school. \n\n\nWhatever happened, \n\n\nit
    wasn\u2019t minor. \n\n\nIt felt serious. \n\n\nToo serious to be forgotten. "
